WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,180
Thousands of miles low, thanks to Yixun

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,780
Who knows these three or five unsociable doubts?

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:13,320
One day there won’t be a huge butterfly effect, dear young master

4
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,120
How come you live in such a difficult place?

5
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,920
I'll ask the dean to change you to a luxurious private ward.

6
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,120
Don't be nosy

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:24,550
How can you have a good rest here?

8
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:26,150
Mr. and Mrs. got it

9
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,150
will blame me

10
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:29,350
They know I was in a car accident, yes

11
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,750
Mr. and Mrs. are very worried about you.

12
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,150
So you asked me to come over and have a look

13
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:33,950
I just saw the doctor and saw the case

14
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,350
Fortunately, you were rushed to the hospital in time

15
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,750
No life-threatening consequences

16
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:37,750
worry about me

17
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:41,590
I'm worried that I won't be willing to come see me in person

18
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:46,160
Mr. and Mrs. are very busy

19
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,560
This is always the reason

20
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,680
Is it as long as you are not dead?

21
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:54,010
They wouldn't take the time to come over and take a look at the young master.

22
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:56,010
I'd better change your ward to another room.

23
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:59,410
Two more caregivers will be assigned to take care of you, young master.

24
00:00:59,410 --> 00:01:03,610
Then I will arrange two caregivers for you.

25
00:01:03,610 --> 00:01:04,810
you woke up

26
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:05,810
you are hurt

27
00:01:05,810 --> 00:01:07,010
I'll bandage it for you again

28
00:01:07,010 --> 00:01:09,590
Don't touch me

29
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:11,790
Isn’t this what the people on the school forum said?
